# Build-context filter for the azure-sim image (Containerfile build context =
# the worktree root). The image only COPYs tools/synthetic_clouds, specs and
# emulators/azure-sim, so local environments, caches and generated artifacts
# are pure transfer weight. Podman accepts this file via ``--ignorefile`` (the
# repository root intentionally carries no .dockerignore: config of record for
# pytest/ruff/mypy lives in the packages, per AGENTS.md).
.git
.venv
.worktrees
.artifacts
.tmp
.pytest_cache
.mypy_cache
.ruff_cache
.pnpm-store
pytest-of-ECUNHA
uvcache
node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/out
**/*.parquet
deploy
d3bis
docs
backups
